  "description": "SABNUH crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C44 H56 Cl2 Cu4 Dy1 N4 O14 1+,4(H2 O1),Cl1 1-. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Cu1 (Cu) has 3 O neighbors; Cu2 (Cu) has 3 O neighbors; Cu3 (Cu) has 3 O neighbors; Cu4 (Cu) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.203-3.419 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.32-109.61°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C44H64N4O18Cl3Cu4Dy. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
